{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102295","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102295/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102295/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102295/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102295","id":2825331542,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6JvPMB","number":102295,"title":"Add toggle state feature to Input class","user":{"login":"Saulo-de-Souza","id":17336909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzM2OTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17336909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza","html_url":"https://github.com/Saulo-de-Souza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-01T17:35:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T14:59:18Z","closed_at":"2025-02-01T20:34:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102295","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102295","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102295.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102295.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This is my first time contributing to the Godot Engine, and I noticed the lack of a built-in toggle feature for input actions. While this can be implemented in game scripts, I have added only about 10 lines of code to provide this functionality directly within the engine.\r\n\r\n**What this PR does:**\r\n- Introduces the method Input.is_action_toggled(\"action_name\"), which maintains a toggle state for an action.\r\n- The first time it is called, it returns false.\r\n- When the action is pressed (or held), it switches to true and remains true until the action is toggled again.\r\n- Works seamlessly within process or physics_process.\r\n- \r\n**Why this is useful:**\r\nThis simplifies toggle-based mechanics (such as switching a flashlight on/off) without requiring additional script logic in user projects.\r\n\r\n**Testing:**\r\n- I've verified that the toggle state updates correctly when an action is pressed.\r\n- I've confirmed that holding the button doesn't repeatedly change the state.\r\n- I've made sure that the feature doesn't interfere with existing input functions (is_action_pressed, is_action_just_pressed, etc.).\r\n\r\nI appreciate any feedback you may have on this implementation. If there's a better approach to achieving this within the existing input system, I'm open to suggestions.\r\n\r\nThank you for reviewing this PR!\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Saulo-de-Souza","id":17336909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzM2OTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17336909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza","html_url":"https://github.com/Saulo-de-Souza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102295/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102295/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}